["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"20VC: How LPs Allocate to Venture in 2026: What They Want, What They Do Not Want | Why Fund Multiple Does Not Matter Without a Timeline | Why Velocity of Cashback is the Most Important Thing with David Morehead, CIO @ Baylor velocity of capital fund of one J curve commingled fund denominator effect\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-twentyvc-大学捐赠基金-cio-基金年限太长-gp-和我们的数学根本不一致/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c5f22493ad40ee05-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:08:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">20VC</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>大學捐贈基金 CIO：基金年限太長，GP 和我們的數學根本不一致</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">私募存在的唯一理由就是賺錢——但 15 到 18 年的基金期限讓 GP 的激勵和捐贈基金的複利數學錯位。真正該追的不是資本回報率，而是資本週轉速度。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">LP視角</span><span class=\"tag\">資產配置</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Norway’s teacher resistance in World War Two Quisling Quisling Youth Service Gestapo\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-witness-挪威教师拒绝教纳粹课-占领者输掉了学校/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4ad7b76f4c635f2c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"W\"><span class=\"dur\">10:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Witness History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>挪威教師拒絕教納粹課，佔領者輸掉了學校</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">德國四周拿下挪威南部，卻四年沒能拿下挪威的課堂：14000名教師中12000人拒絕加入納粹教師工會，1000多人被送進集中營，回來後仍不是會員。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">二戰</span><span class=\"tag\">挪威</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"#407 ‒ Preventing cardiovascular and Alzheimer&#x27;s disease: lowering LDL early, APOE4, and promising new therapies | Michael Davidson, M.D. CETP APOE4 P-tau 217 MFSD2A lysoPC DHA Lp(a)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-thepeterattiad-把-ldl-压到-80-以下-可能一辈子不得心脏病/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d415dc8503c1c8f1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:59:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">The Peter Attia Drive</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>把 LDL 壓到 80 以下，可能一輩子不得心臟病</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">8 克法則：LDL 200 撐 40 年、100 撐 80 年、80 撐 100 年，累計都是 8 克膽固醇。心梗前降最有效，心衰後再降就沒用了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>12</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>11</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">心血管</span><span class=\"tag\">阿爾茨海默</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Home Depot rapid deployment center market delivery operations direct fulfillment center stack &#x27;em high, watch &#x27;em fly Six Sigma\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-acquired-home-depot-上市以来回报第一-靠的不是卖便宜货/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0a629c40221e1a9c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">3:35:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Acquired</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>Home Depot 上市以來回報第一，靠的不是賣便宜貨</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">它把教育打包進零售：顧客問怎麼修，店員就停下來教。25 美分的墊圈能帶出十萬美元的廚房翻新，這種價值沒法用 Six Sigma 表格管理。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">零售</span><span class=\"tag\">供應鏈</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Ep. 400: Dennett Rejects Qualia (Part One) qualia Cartesian theater access consciousness multiple drafts model center of gravity heterophenomenology\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-pel-丹尼特否认感受质-颜色不在外面-也不在里面/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2f8ad674feef51a4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">52:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Partially Examined Life</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>丹尼特否認感受質：顏色不在外面，也不在裡面</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">丹尼特不否認我們覺得有感受質，他否認的是感受質這個被實體化的東西存在——就像重心是抽象，不是身體裡的一個點。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">意識哲學</span><span class=\"tag\">丹尼特</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The KGB Double Agent Who Stopped Armageddon with Ben McIntyre MICE RockX Minox Tudeh Party brush contact dead drop\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-historyhit-一个苏联间谍的难言之隐-差点阻止了第三次世界大战/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1f92a8a9105bdcbd-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">41:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>一個蘇聯間諜的難言之隱，差點阻止了第三次世界大戰</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1981年，克格勃駐德黑蘭高官主動向MI6投誠，動機不是錢也不是意識形態，而是他相信西方能治好他的性功能障礙——他交出的情報，讓美英決定把蘇聯政變計劃交給伊朗人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">冷戰</span><span class=\"tag\">間諜</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"646: The Secret of My Death Memento Mori medevac frogman\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-tal-死后你留下的不是死因-是别人拼凑的你/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/25f52c21084864d0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:07:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">This American Life</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>死後你留下的不是死因，是別人拼湊的你</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">三個故事都在做同一件事：人死後，親友只能靠短信、訃告、Facebook 留言這些零碎證據去還原一個已經無法開口的人——而拼出來的那個版本，往往和本人認知完全對不上。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">敘事播客</span><span class=\"tag\">死亡</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Neurodiversity, Autism, Awe, and Religious Experience (with Jonathan Machnee) neurodivergent profound autism cognitive dissonance pressure cooker collective effervescence double empathy problem cessationism\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-13-clearerthink-自闭症不是一条线-是十维谱系加四个遗传簇/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d6c2f45dd923b89a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:35:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Clearer Thinking</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0913</span></div>\n<h2>自閉症不是一條線，是十維譜系加四個遺傳簇</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">DSM-5 把馬斯克和無法自己穿衣服的人塞進同一個桶，但自閉症沒有生物標誌物，只有四個遺傳簇和一堆被誤讀的標籤。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">神經多樣性</span><span class=\"tag\">自閉症</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"E199 AI投研的邊界、能力與實戰卡點 I David對話崗底斯首席 FDE FDE MOE Harness ETL QA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-13-touzishizhan-ai-不会让普通人变优秀-只会让优秀的人更优秀/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/84ddf31325c222e2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"投\"><span class=\"dur\">1:19:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">投資實戰派</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0913</span></div>\n<h2>AI 不會讓普通人變優秀，只會讓優秀的人更優秀</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">投研 Agent 的卡點不在模型，在數據治理和人的判斷力；用海外模型會讓你越來越笨，用國內模型逼你越來越聰明。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI投研</span><span class=\"tag\">Agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"705. Queen Victoria’s Revenge: The Mad Emperor of Abyssinia (Part 1) Abyssinia Magdala Theodros II Hormuzd Rassam Walter Plowden Charles Duncan Cameron\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-13-restishistory-英国远征阿比西尼亚-一个皇帝把外交官全扣了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4d082c6220b28920-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:10:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0913</span></div>\n<h2>英國遠征阿比西尼亞：一個皇帝把外交官全扣了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">維多利亞女王沒回一封信，特沃德羅斯二世就把英國領事、傳教士全鎖進馬格達拉山頂，等來的是一支遠征軍。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">帝國史</span><span class=\"tag\">埃塞俄比亞</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Silicon Valley’s Starving for Compute Neocloud Neolab reticle panel level packaging RSI\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-13-asianometry-2027-年算力会从短缺变成过剩-ai-泡沫未必破/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bde50d837c58c490-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">21:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0913</span></div>\n<h2>2027 年算力會從短缺變成過剩，AI 泡沫未必破</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">2026 年底可用 AI 數據中心約 15 吉瓦，2027 年底衝到 45-55 吉瓦，增量 30-40 吉瓦。按每吉瓦 500 億美元收入算，兩家巨頭要做出 7500 億到 1.5 萬億美元，這個數字站不住。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">半導體</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"395. Stalin: The Rise of A Tyrant (Part 1) Koba Bolsheviks / Mensheviks Russification\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-13-empirehist-斯大林在革命里只是个管账的-后来却成了总书记/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1805b3753086ecbd-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">33:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Empire 世界史</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0913</span></div>\n<h2>斯大林在革命裡只是個管賬的，後來卻成了總書記</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1917年列寧和托洛茨基在街頭號召起義時，斯大林在做沒人願意幹的組織與籌款工作。他後來成為總書記，靠的不是演說，而是坐在桌邊。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">蘇聯史</span><span class=\"tag\">權力結構</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"8 Ways To Improve Your Outbound Sales outbound intent signals breakup message deliverability Sales Navigator\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-13-ycsp-外联回复率接近零-先别怪文案-先查你在发给谁/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b47caf90a5aa280a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">12:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Y Combinator</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0913</span></div>\n<h2>外聯回覆率接近零，先別怪文案，先查你在發給誰</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">外聯像大海撈針：人不對，再完美的文案也不會落地。YC 合夥人給出的調試順序是——先查收件人、再查公司、再看標題，最後才輪到文案。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>11</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">外聯銷售</span><span class=\"tag\">早期創業</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"World Models, Robotics, and the Future of 3D AI world model Gaussian splat real to sim bullet time SFT\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-13-a16z-世界模型不是视频生成-atlas-把-3d-控制做成了输入/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">23:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0913</span></div>\n<h2>世界模型不是視頻生成：Atlas 把 3D 控制做成了輸入</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">語言模型處理 token，世界模型處理物理空間。Atlas 的關鍵不是生成更長的視頻，而是把相機和參考圖放進 3D 座標裡當輸入，讓生成從老虎機變成導演。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">世界模型</span><span class=\"tag\">3D 生成</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"HoP 499 Beyond Belief: Bayle, Toleration, and Atheism invincible ignorance Manichaeism Theophrastus Redivivus\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-13-hopwag-第一个公开的无神论者-其实是个不敢出书的乡村神父/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ec115ed691f40c47-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">23:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">History of Philosophy Without Any Gaps</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0913</span></div>\n<h2>第一個公開的無神論者，其實是個不敢出書的鄉村神父</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">梅利耶寫下了否定上帝存在的《遺書》，卻只敢抄三份留給身後；貝爾則用懷疑論證明，宗教問題超出理性，因此沒人有資格以信仰之名迫害他人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>19</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">無神論</span><span class=\"tag\">宗教寬容</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1357: Furin, Naturally with Paul Bieinasz furin cleavage site NSP15 RXXR sarbecovirus OC43\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-13-twiv-造一个-furin-位点根本不难-难的是承认它不罕见/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><div class=\"fallback\">T</div><span class=\"dur\">1:44:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0913</span></div>\n<h2>造一個 furin 位點根本不難，難的是承認它不罕見</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">深度測序顯示，冠狀病毒基因組裡每千個就有幾個帶插入，furin 位點在同一位置至少被獨立撞上三次——實驗室起源論的概率論證站不住腳。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">病毒學</span><span class=\"tag\">深度測序</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The First Punic War corvus Mamertines Mix-Hellenes Monte Fortino\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-13-ancients-罗马的胜利靠一只乌鸦-第一次布匿战争的关键/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2e86106fe99ba32a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:01:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0913</span></div>\n<h2>羅馬的勝利靠一隻烏鴉：第一次布匿戰爭的關鍵</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">羅馬靠一種叫 corvus 的登船吊橋把海戰變成陸戰，抵消了迦太基的水手優勢；但迦太基請來一位斯巴達人重整軍隊，反手俘虜了羅馬執政官。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">古代史</span><span class=\"tag\">羅馬</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"92. Is Poor Nutrition a Supply Problem or a Demand Problem? food desert external locus of control Nielsen Home Scan\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-13-nostupid-开一家新超市-只解决-10-的营养不平等/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/85138dbf8396e511-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">32:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">No Stupid Questions</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0913</span></div>\n<h2>開一家新超市，只解決 10% 的營養不平等</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">把健康食品的供給鋪到低收入社區，只能縮小約 10% 的營養不平等，剩下 90% 由需求端決定——而需求是可以被稅收和文化改變的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">行為經濟學</span><span class=\"tag\">公共政策</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Episode 252 - The Ice Age icehouse greenhouse cirque dropstone albedo\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-13-thecommondesce-冰期不是无尽的冬天-而是反复的分合/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f1123c3476b2c469-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">2:10:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">The Common Descent Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0913</span></div>\n<h2>冰期不是無盡的冬天，而是反覆的分合</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">冰期與間冰期來回切換，把種群反覆隔離又重連，這才是冰期塑造物種的真正機制；而人類活動可能把下一次冰期推遲數十萬年。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">古氣候</span><span class=\"tag\">冰川</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"363: Why Vegetables Are Good for Your Heart settle plate DNIC EPR sGC mTORC1\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-12-thisweekinmicr-本生灯不减少平板污染-蔬菜护心另有机制/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/edf553b27ee2c1ff-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">58:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Microbiology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0912</span></div>\n<h2>本生燈不減少平板汙染，蔬菜護心另有機制</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">本生燈在低汙染環境下反而可能增加沉降菌落；蔬菜護心可能不是硝酸鹽-亞硝酸鹽-NO 通路，而是腸道菌把硝酸鹽和鐵做成 DNIC 直接激活 sGC。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">微生物學</span><span class=\"tag\">無菌操作</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"We Asked Fidelity&#x27;s Ex-President What Made Peter Lynch Great — and Where Private Credit Risk Hides private credit affiliated investments rating shopping auto-IRA reversion to the mean\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-12-excessreturns-私募信贷的风险藏在保险公司的评级里/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3cac5e72b6049e76-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:00:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Excess Returns</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0912</span></div>\n<h2>私募信貸的風險藏在保險公司的評級裡</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">私募信貸大量進入保險公司，且多為關聯方投資，評級由私營機構給出、系統性偏高；若按正確評級，保險公司每年要多留 4000-5000 億美元資本。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">私募信貸</span><span class=\"tag\">保險公司</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The History of Perfume: Mankind&#x27;s Millennia Long Battle Against Stank miasma theory ambergris nosegay fixative\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-12-extracredits-人类几千年对抗恶臭-香水最初是烧给神的烟/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8ffaf32042b4c196-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">16:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">ExtraCredits</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0912</span></div>\n<h2>人類幾千年對抗惡臭，香水最初是燒給神的煙</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">香水不是從奢侈享受開始的，而是從宗教焚香和防病開始的——歐洲人相信難聞的空氣會傳播疾病，於是用香味把自己圍起來。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">香水史</span><span class=\"tag\">宗教儀式</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI:AM Highlights: Astra as AGI, OpenAI&#x27;s Pause, Mythos @ Mozilla &amp; Human Agency vs Technocapitalism agent workday METR paper clipper safe harbor Dyson sphere\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-12-cogrev-astra-跨过-agi-门槛-但没人能审计它/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/36e51d00f0d50003-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:42:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0912</span></div>\n<h2>Astra 跨過 AGI 門檻，但沒人能審計它</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Astra 讓人類再也不用做某些任務，OpenAI 卻只暫停了一半 RL 算力；外部審計被卡死在發布前兩三天，房間裡沒有大人可以接鍋。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">Astra</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Open Models Change The Economics of AI harness open weights router MLX DGX Spark\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-12-ycsp-企业最终八成-token-走开源模型-但只花两成预算/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f442bffca180d6cf-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">57:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Y Combinator</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0912</span></div>\n<h2>企業最終八成 token 走開源模型，但只花兩成預算</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">開源模型和閉源前沿模型不是替代關係：絕大多數 token 會走開源，最難的活留給前沿實驗室，中間靠路由和編排把兩者接起來。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>12</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">開源模型</span><span class=\"tag\">推理成本</span>\n</div></div></a>"]